# Substitua pelo seu token (sem espaços)
@token=TEST-2641258245009571-051808-801b1ddb694653d05c76460c769f1569-3411018746
@plan_id_basico = 68070d05852a4886834463e8ca318441


### 1 — Valida se o token está funcionando (deve retornar seus dados)
GET https://api.mercadopago.com/users/me
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}


###


### 2 — Busca os dados do plano Básico (verifica se o plano existe e está ativo)
GET https://api.mercadopago.com/preapproval_plan/{{plan_id_basico}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}


###


### 3 — Cria assinatura direto na API do MP (sem passar pelo seu backend)
POST https://api.mercadopago.com/preapproval
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "preapproval_plan_id": "{{plan_id_basico}}",
  "payer_email": "test_user_123@testuser.com",
  "back_url": "http://localhost:5173?assinatura=sucesso",
  "status": "pending",
  "reason": "Plano MenuPoint"
}


###


### 4 — Cria plano de teste Básico
POST https://api.mercadopago.com/preapproval_plan
Authorization: Bearer TEST-2641258245009571-051808-801b1ddb694653d05c76460c769f1569-3411018746
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "reason": "Plano Básico MenuPoint",
  "auto_recurring": {
    "frequency": 1,
    "frequency_type": "months",
    "transaction_amount": 49.90,
    "currency_id": "BRL"
  },
  "payment_methods_allowed": {
    "payment_types": [{ "id": "credit_card" }]
  },
  "back_url": "https://example.com"
}


###


### 5 — Cria plano de teste Pro
POST https://api.mercadopago.com/preapproval_plan
Authorization: Bearer TEST-2641258245009571-051808-801b1ddb694653d05c76460c769f1569-3411018746
