### 6 — Criar usuário de teste comprador
POST https://api.mercadopago.com/users/test_user
Authorization: Bearer TEST-2641258245009571-051808-801b1ddb694653d05c76460c769f1569-3411018746
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "site_id": "MLB"
}